  "decision_rule": "Reject the null hypothesis (that there is no difference in mean adjusted efficiency variance between cut-heavy and drive-heavy shapers) if the p-value from a two-sided t-test (or non-parametric equivalent) is less than 0.05. Given the severe sample size limitation, any statistically significant finding would be highly suspect and require substantial replication.",
  "data_version": "NBA 2022-23, 2023-24, 2024-25 complete seasons and playoffs. The 2025-26 partial data should be excluded to avoid confounding due to incomplete season statistics and potential player movement or role changes within that partial season."
 }
}

